{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15d0_level_act15d0_03_end",
  "groupId": "act15d0",
  "stageId": "act15d0_03",
  "title": "首次遇袭",
  "storyCode": "MB-3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d0fe9df4df3b1f9e40b61575ea04987dfad32f68247466750dc63d7a99f219f4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A区囚犯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "（这个囚犯好强！其他囚犯都被他几下就放倒了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......去死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狱警B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "（这个狱警也很厉害，但是，她为什么好像只是在防守......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狱警B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "（糟了，狱警倒下了.....）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "（只剩下我了，但是要是我在这里和他战斗的话，之后要怎么解释。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......还有你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "（怎么办，难道只能动手了吗。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......真快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "（安东尼，救下了我？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "虽然不知道你们是谁，但是你们不该这么做，不该在我的眼前这么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿嘿，死到临头了还关心别人吗，真是绅士作风啊，安东尼先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "（什么时候？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿嘿，小姑娘，别怪我，要怪就怪你运气不好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "放心，除了安东尼，我们不想杀人，你就在这睡一会吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "（糟了！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（被他得手了......)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "(意识，开始模糊了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......让我们来......招待你......安东尼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......死......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "没想到梅尔小姐你的厨艺真不错呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅尔",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "哼哼，没想到吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "不过，被卷入了另一个杀手的刺杀中然后昏迷过去了吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "真是不幸呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅尔",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "是啊，好倒霉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "那么这场刺杀是怎么收场的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "虽然我们知道安东尼肯定赢了，但是毕竟这可是发生在监狱中的刺杀，不会就草草了之的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅尔",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "嗯，不过因为那时候罗宾还昏迷着，所以要从卡夫卡那边讲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "咦，卡夫卡不也被那个囚犯打晕过去了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅尔",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "啊，她说那是她装的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "啊......原来如此，确实有她之前表现出的风格呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "说，是谁派你们来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿......嘿......你不会......知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......昏过去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "这些人难道是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......罢了，现在想这些也没有意义，先看看这些囚犯的状况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "囚犯们",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "看来他们确实没有下死手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "还有这个小姑娘......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "虽然不知道是谁，但是刚才帮助了我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "谢谢你，不知名的小姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你可以叫我卡夫卡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "嗯？你没晕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "哎，别动，身体往右边挪一下，挡住监控。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "可以了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好了，这样监控应该看不到我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "幸好我打扫房间的时候观察了一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "你是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "我说了，你可以叫我卡夫卡，我是来帮你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "不过真是倒霉，本来想找个机会给你留个纸条就完事了的，结果没想到正好撞上他们出手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "到底是怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "这里不是可以说话的地方，你知道哪里可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......狱警们该听到动静赶过来了，我们可以去医务室，那里可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴顿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么回事！安东尼，你在搞什么鬼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "这是我想问的，巴顿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "这些囚犯里混进了想要刺杀我的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "你在搞什么鬼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴顿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狱警B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是真的，巴顿队长，我看到那两个囚犯把安东尼先生围了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴顿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什么？你不是看着他们的吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狱警B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我被那两个囚犯放倒了，他们挺......很强。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴顿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啧，没用的家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴顿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "发生这种事，你让我怎么向典狱长交待？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "先解决现状吧，巴顿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "这两个人都是刺客，你们处理一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴顿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咳咳，但是，安东尼先生，你看，这件事我们不能就因为你的一面之词就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "我受了点伤，需要先去医务室一趟，其他人都被他们打昏了，也送去医务室看一看比较好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "去过医务室后，我自然会去和你详细说说这件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴顿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好的好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴顿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们几个还愣着干什么，把这两具尸体丢去停尸间，这些人也都拖出去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狱警",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是、是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狱警",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜玛",
      "speakerId": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "狱警们都走了，安东尼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜玛",
      "speakerId": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "发生了什么，我看他们都很慌张的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "我也想知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "好了，这里是安全的，卡夫卡小姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "杜玛是我的朋友，如果说我在这座监狱里有能够信任的人，那就只有她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "首先，不要叫我小姑娘，我只是个子矮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "抱歉，卡夫卡小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "......你这家伙，明明是囚犯，却比外面的人还要有礼貌诶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜玛",
      "speakerId": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "安东尼就是这样的，他对谁都很有礼貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "原来如此，明明很能打，却又很有礼貌，难怪这里的其他人都觉得你很厉害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "过奖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "那么，轮到我问问题了。你似乎是来协助我的，也就是说，你知道这些来刺杀我的人的来历吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "嗯......在那之前，我要先问你一个问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "请问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "你知道自己家，或者说以你父亲的姓氏命名的西蒙公司究竟发生了什么事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "要是你知道的话，我就不用解释得很复杂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......我的父亲受到了十多项指控，我知道这背后肯定不简单，但具体的我没有时间去了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "既然你知道，那倒是好办一点了，西蒙公司因为非......非什么来着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "你是想说，非法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "哦对！非法走私源石制品罪！反正公司直接被查封了，公司核心成员全都进了监狱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "你的家人现在都还全部在堡垒山城监狱服刑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜玛",
      "speakerId": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "安东尼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......我没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "我很早就做好了心理准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "他们没死，我已经很高兴了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "那么，是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "海德兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "海德兄弟，果然是你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "让我想想，赫默怎么说的来着......对了，你的家族，西蒙家族原本和他们是在某条线上的竞争关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "你们互相占着这条线50%的利益，而且经常会有一些摩擦，而他们一直想要把你们这一份也占了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "然后他们就做了，就这么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......海德兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "我经常听父亲提起这个名字，甚至去过他们公司做客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜玛",
      "speakerId": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "居然为了一点私欲就做出这样的事情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "我也听说过一些类似的事情，只是没想到居然真的发生在我身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜玛",
      "speakerId": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "安东尼，你没事吧，需要我用法术舒缓一下你的精神吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "不用，谢谢你，杜玛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "我说过，我早有心理准备，只是没有想到事实来得这么突然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "我相信你，卡夫卡小姐，我想你没有任何理由在这件事上欺骗我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "既然如此，那些刺客应该是海德兄弟派来的吧，他们为什么事到如今才来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "这个我是真的不知道，不过根据我的经验，刚才那绝对不是唯一的一拨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "他们肯定派了好几拨人来刺杀你，也就是说，把这当成刚刚开始比较好哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "那么你呢，想必你不是只为了帮我抵挡这些杀手而来的吧？你的目的是什么，卡夫卡小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "我？嗯......一时半会不好解释，反正我是受人委托来帮你越狱的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "难道你不想出去报仇吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "你判的是终身监禁，而且是没有假释的那种。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "如果你要离开这里，那么你的选择就只有一个，那就是——越狱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "而我正是来帮你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "当然啦，你要是不愿意出去，想在这里待一辈子，我当然也不会硬要拉你出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜玛",
      "speakerId": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "越狱......但是从没有人能够顺利逃出这座监狱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "诶，说是这么说，但是总是要试一试的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......你已经来到这座监狱一段时间了，卡夫卡小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "嗯？对啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "那你应该听说了一些我的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "嗯，他们都说你是最强的囚犯也是最自由的囚犯，大部分囚犯都觉得你很厉害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "我现在也觉得你挺厉害的，这种时候都还能保持冷静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......但事实并不是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "即使我再有所谓的人格魅力，身为囚犯，想要折服这些狱警乃至典狱长也是不可能的，我本不应当获得现在的地位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "啊，这倒是没错，但它就是发生了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "事实上，我得到了狱卒们的优待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "至少据我所知，典狱长亲口交代他们，对我“好一点”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "这些年我一直在怀疑，我在来到铸铁城后被捕，然后来到这座监狱，是不是我父亲一开始安排好的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "他预见到了什么，而提前将我送到这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "我总是在想这样的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "啊，赫默也是这么说的，不过她说这也只是一种可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "赫默，是你背后的人的名字吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "啊......算了，没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "事后我会感谢这位朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "总之，如你所说，这也只是一种可能性，如果我想知道原因，我就必须出去，这件事只有我自己才能搞清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜玛",
      "speakerId": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "安东尼，告诉她真的没关系吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "没关系。我暂且相信你，卡夫卡小姐，所以我愿意向你开诚布公。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "即使你没来，即使我早已习惯了在这座监狱的生活，我也无时不刻地想要离开这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "我能在这里获得大部分我想要的东西，但是对于如何离开这里却也始终没有头绪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "所以其实应该是我请求你，卡夫卡小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "请你协助我越狱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
